{
 "about": "What a simplified policy with operation ALL does with a condition and with a predicate. x30-policy-operation-all records that ALL matches READ and DELETE for a policy with neither. oa1 pairs a condition with ALL: true for a = y and false for a = n on both operations means the condition is evaluated, true for all four means ALL drops it, and a refused upload means the form is outside the language. oa2 pairs a predicate with ALL and asks two filter operations for it.",
